@guide H_Badlands
@name Badlands (Kargath)
@faction Horde
@levels 35-38
@zone Badlands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Kargath's reagent run, coyotes and the advisor's lost baggage, Lotwil Veriatus's rock elementals and Rigglefuzz's power stones. Getting there is the hard part: see the first step.
@next H_Stranglethorn

note Kargath has no flight path until you reach it. From Hammerfall cross Thandol Span into the Wetlands and ride east through Loch Modan into the Badlands (Alliance zones: keep off the roads). Kargath is on the west edge of the Badlands.
fp Kargath
accept Badlands Reagent Run | Jarkal Mossmeld, Kargath. Needs level 36.
accept Coyote Thieves | Neeka Bloodscar.
accept Unclaimed Baggage | Advisor Sarophas. Needs level 36.
accept 710 Study of the Elements: Rock | Lotwil Veriatus, east of Kargath.
complete 710 Study of the Elements: Rock | Lesser Rock Elementals around Lotwil's camp.
turnin 710 Study of the Elements: Rock
accept 711 Study of the Elements: Rock
complete 711 Study of the Elements: Rock | Rock Elementals north-west of the camp.
complete Badlands Reagent Run [obj=3] | Rock Elemental Shards from the same Rock Elementals.
turnin 711 Study of the Elements: Rock
accept Power Stones | Rigglefuzz at the camp in the middle of the Badlands.
complete Coyote Thieves | Crag Coyotes all over the middle of the zone.
complete Badlands Reagent Run [obj=2] | Crag Coyote Fangs from the same coyotes.
complete Unclaimed Baggage | The pack in a barrel and the rapier on a weapon rack at Agmond's End, north.
complete Power Stones | Shadowforge Surveyors at Agmond's End and around Uldaman's entrance.
complete Badlands Reagent Run [obj=1] | Buzzard Gizzards from Starving Buzzards in the north-east.
turnin Power Stones | Rigglefuzz.
turnin Coyote Thieves | Kargath.
turnin Badlands Reagent Run
turnin Unclaimed Baggage
level 38
train | Fly to Orgrimmar or the Undercity to train.
note Fly from Kargath to the Undercity and take the zeppelin to Grom'gol (Stranglethorn).
